<section class="hero" id="hero"><div class="hero-bg"></div><div class="particles" id="particles"></div><div class="hero-content"><h1><span>Smart</span><br><span class="gt">Justice for Every Bangladeshi Citizen</span></h1><p>A ai is a next-generation, privacy-preserving legal aid platform bringing autonomous AI dispute resolution, voice-first Bengali intake, and zero-knowledge cryptography to 682,500+ vulnerable citizens across all 64 districts of Bangladesh.</p><div class="hero-buttons"><a href="contact.html" class="btn-p"><i class="fas fa-life-ring"></i> Get Legal Help</a><a href="ai.html" class="btn-s"><i class="fas fa-robot"></i> Explore A ai Platform</a></div><div class="hero-stats"><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">682,500+</div><div class="label">Target Beneficiaries</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">300</div><div class="label">Pilot Unions</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">$3.24M</div><div class="label">EU Funding</div></div><div class="hero-stat"><div class="num">64</div><div class="label">Districts Nationwide</div></div></div></div></section>

<section id="quick-access" style="padding:4rem 0"><div class="container">
  <div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Start Here</div><h2>What do you need help with?</h2><p>Choose a path - every service is free, confidential, and available in Bangla and English.</p></div>
  <div class="pgrid">
    <a href="contact.html" class="pcard reveal"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.15);color:#10b981"><i class="fas fa-life-ring"></i></div><h3>Get Legal Help</h3><p>Apply for free legal aid or reach a case officer. Call <b>16430</b> or file online.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.12);color:#10b981">Start application</span></a>
    <a href="sheguard.html" class="pcard reveal rd1"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(251,113,133,.15);color:#fb7185"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div><h3>Women's Safety</h3><p>SheGuard X - discreet protection, emergency help and safe reporting for women.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(251,113,133,.12);color:#fb7185">SheGuard X</span></a>
    <a href="justice.html" class="pcard reveal rd2"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444"><i class="fas fa-map-marked-alt"></i></div><h3>Find My District</h3><p>Locate courts, legal aid offices and emergency helplines across all 64 districts.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.12);color:#ef4444">Justice Map</span></a>
    <a href="government.html" class="pcard reveal rd3"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.15);color:#10b981"><i class="fas fa-landmark"></i></div><h3>Government e-Services</h3><p>Access structure, e-service portals and the grievance redressal system.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.12);color:#10b981">Government</span></a>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section id="problem"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">The Crisis</div><h2>7.5 Million Cases. Millions Left Behind.</h2><p>Bangladesh's judicial system faces unprecedented strain across all 64 districts, with vulnerable populations bearing the heaviest burden.</p></div><div class="pgrid">
<div class="pcard reveal"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444"><i class="fas fa-gavel"></i></div><h3>Judicial Backlog</h3><p>Over 7.5M cases clog the judicial pipeline.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444">7.5M+ pending</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd1"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b"><i class="fas fa-user-slash"></i></div><h3>Literacy Barriers</h3><p>Complex forms exclude millions of illiterate citizens.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b">Low digital access</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd2"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.15);color:#ec4899"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i></div><h3>GBV Vulnerability</h3><p>Victims fear public exposure, lacking safe channels.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.15);color:#ec4899">Critical safety gap</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd3"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444"><i class="fas fa-file-alt"></i></div><h3>Paper Bureaucracy</h3><p>Fragmented manual systems create massive inefficiencies.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444">Months of delays</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd4"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.15);color:#10b981"><i class="fas fa-map-marker-alt"></i></div><h3>Geographic Isolation</h3><p>Multi-day connectivity blackouts during monsoons.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.15);color:#10b981">Connectivity collapses</span></div>
<div class="pcard reveal rd5"><div class="picon" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.15);color:#a855f7"><i class="fas fa-coins"></i></div><h3>Payment Delays</h3><p>Panel lawyers wait months for invoicing.</p><span class="shl" style="background:rgba(168,85,247,.15);color:#a855f7">Months of waiting</span></div>
</div></div></section>
<section id="solution" style="background:rgba(2,6,23,.5)"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">The Solution</div><h2>A ai: Next-Gen Legal Aid</h2><p>An AI-augmented, privacy-preserving platform serving vulnerable citizens across all 64 districts.</p></div><div class="sol-show"><div class="sol-vis reveal">
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-mobile-alt"></i><span>Multimodal Ingestion | Voice, USSD, Vision AI</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-brain"></i><span>Cognitive AI | Legal-SLM &amp; RAG Engine</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-shield-alt"></i><span>Zero-Knowledge Privacy Vault (zk-SNARKs)</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-video"></i><span>Virtual ODR | WebRTC Mediation</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i><span>Automated Settlement &amp; Merkle Audit</span></div>
<div class="aarrow"><i class="fas fa-arrow-down"></i></div>
<div class="alayer"><i class="fas fa-mobile"></i><span>MFS Honorarium | bKash Auto-Payout</span></div>
</div><div class="sol-feat reveal rd2">
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(16,185,129,.15);color:#10b981"><i class="fas fa-microphone"></i></div><div><h4>Voice-First Bengali AI</h4><p>Dialect-adaptive agents for Chittagonian, Sylheti, Rangpuri.</p></div></div>
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(239,68,68,.15);color:#ef4444"><i class="fas fa-eye"></i></div><div><h4>Vision AI Parser</h4><p>Transformer OCR on handwritten Bengali land deeds, 94%+ accuracy.</p></div></div>
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(236,72,153,.15);color:#ec4899"><i class="fas fa-lock"></i></div><div><h4>Zero-Knowledge Privacy</h4><p>zk-SNARK proofs protect GBV survivors without exposing details.</p></div></div>
<div class="sfeat"><div class="sficon" style="background:rgba(245,158,11,.15);color:#f59e0b"><i class="fas fa-wifi"></i></div><div><h4>14-Day Offline</h4><p>CRDT-powered edge kiosks operate fully offline.</p></div></div>
</div></div></div></section>
<section id="flow"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">User Journey</div><h2>Voice-First Intake Flow</h2><p>How citizens like Rokeya access justice through a simple phone call in any district.</p></div><div class="fsteps">
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#047857)">1</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Dials Toll-Free 16430</h3><p>Missed call triggers auto-callback in her local dialect.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-phone"></i> PSTN Voice Gateway</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ef4444,#dc2626)">2</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Conversational AI Intake</h3><p>Voice Agent gathers facts via natural speech.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-brain"></i> Whisper ASR</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#10b981,#059669)">3</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Automated Triage</h3><p>AI runs means-test and routes to Village Court.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-check-double"></i> Auto-Triage</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#f59e0b,#d97706)">4</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Case Minted</h3><p>Cryptographically minted case with officer alert.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-certificate"></i> Merkle Trail</div></div></div>
<div class="fstep reveal"><div class="fstepnum" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ec4899,#db2777)">5</div><div class="fstepc"><h3>Confirmation</h3><p>Voice confirmation and SMS sent.</p><div class="stch"><i class="fas fas fa-sms"></i> Voice + SMS</div></div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section class="sstats" id="impact"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Target Impact</div><h2>Transformation at Scale</h2><p>Measurable outcomes across all 64 districts by 2030.</p></div><div class="sg">
<div class="si reveal"><div class="sn" data-target="40" data-suffix="%" data-decimals="0">0%</div><div class="sl">Dispute Diversion to AI-ODR</div></div>
<div class="si reveal rd1"><div class="sn" data-target="50000" data-suffix="+" data-decimals="0">0+</div><div class="sl">Concurrent Peak Sessions</div></div>
<div class="si reveal rd2"><div class="sn" data-target="99.95" data-suffix="%" data-decimals="2">0%</div><div class="sl">System Uptime</div></div>
<div class="si reveal rd3"><div class="sn">&lt;150ms</div><div class="sl">API P99 Response</div></div>
</div></div></section>
<section id="partners"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Strategic Partners</div><h2>Backed by Global Institutions</h2></div><div class="pg">
<div class="part reveal"><div class="plogo">🇪🇺</div><div class="pname">European Union</div><div style="color:#475569;font-size:.75rem">Funding Partner</div></div>
<div class="part reveal rd1"><div class="plogo">🇺🇳</div><div class="pname">UNDP Bangladesh</div><div style="color:#475569;font-size:.75rem">Technical Partner</div></div>
