</div></div></section>
<section id="nationwide" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(16,185,129,.06),rgba(239,68,68,.06))"><div class="container"><div class="section-header"><div class="section-tag">Nationwide Reach</div><h2>Covering All 64 Districts of Bangladesh</h2><p>From coastal Cox's Bazar to hill-tracted Rangamati, from metropolitan Dhaka to remote haor regions - A ai reaches every corner.</p></div><div class="dchips"><span class="dchip">Dhaka</span><span class="dchip">Chattogram</span><span class="dchip">Sylhet</span><span class="dchip">Rajshahi</span><span class="dchip">Khulna</span><span class="dchip">Barishal</span><span class="dchip">Rangpur</span><span class="dchip">Mymensingh</span><span class="dchip">Comilla</span><span class="dchip">Gazipur</span><span class="dchip">Narayanganj</span><span class="dchip">Brahmanbaria</span><span class="dchip">Chandpur</span><span class="dchip">Lakshmipur</span><span class="dchip">Noakhali</span><span class="dchip">Feni</span><span class="dchip">Bandarban</span><span class="dchip">Rangamati</span><span class="dchip">Khagrachari</span><span class="dchip">Habiganj</span><span class="dchip">Moulvibazar</span><span class="dchip">Sunamganj</span><span class="dchip">Tangail</span><span class="dchip">Jamalpur</span><span class="dchip">Sherpur</span><span class="dchip">Netrakona</span><span class="dchip">Kishoreganj</span><span class="dchip">Narsingdi</span><span class="dchip">Manikganj</span><span class="dchip">Munshiganj</span><span class="dchip">Faridpur</span><span class="dchip">Gopalganj</span><span class="dchip">Madarpur</span><span class="dchip">Rajbari</span><span class="dchip">Shariatpur</span><span class="dchip">Narail</span><span class="dchip">Magura</span><span class="dchip">Jhenaidah</span><span class="dchip">Kushtia</span><span class="dchip">Chuadanga</span><span class="dchip">Meherpur</span><span class="dchip">Satkhira</span><span class="dchip">Bagerhat</span><span class="dchip">Pirojpur</span><span class="dchip">Jhalokathi</span><span class="dchip">Patuakhali</span><span class="dchip">Barguna</span><span class="dchip">Bogura</span><span class="dchip">Joypurhat</span><span class="dchip">Naogaon</span><span class="dchip">Natore</span><span class="dchip">Chapainawabganj</span><span class="dchip">Sirajganj</span><span class="dchip">Pabna</span><span class="dchip">Kurigram</span><span class="dchip">Dinajpur</span><span class="dchip">Thakurgaon</span><span class="dchip">Nilphamari</span><span class="dchip">Lalmonirhat</span><span class="dchip">Gaibandha</span><span class="dchip">Panchagarh</span></div></div></section>
